#: data/text/match_call.inc:2017
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Mom1"
msgid ""
"MOM: Your father and you…\n"
"Everyone is captivated by POKéMON.\p"
"What is the charm of POKéMON?\p"
"Me?\n"
"I adore POKéMON that help me with\l"
"my everyday chores.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2025
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Mom2"
msgid ""
"MOM: Hi, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Your father keeps himself locked\l"
"away in the PETALBURG GYM.\p"
"He comes home every so often.\n"
"But he goes back to the GYM when\l"
"he's eaten everything he can.\p"
"I'm guessing that losing to you\n"
"was a big blow to his pride!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2035
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Mom3"
msgid ""
"MOM: {PLAYER}…\n"
"Don't worry about me or the house.\p"
"Wear those RUNNING SHOES until\n"
"they fall apart, honey!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2041
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Roxanne_Preparing"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: Oh, hello, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I've been hard at work retraining\n"
"since we met.\p"
"I will still need some more time\n"
"before I can reopen the GYM.\p"
"But when I do, please visit my GYM\n"
"for a rematch!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2050
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Roxanne_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: Is this {PLAYER}?\n"
"Congratulations!\l"
"I've been hearing about you!\p"
"As for me, I need some more time\n"
"before I can reopen the GYM.\p"
"But when I do, please visit my GYM\n"
"for a rematch!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2059
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Roxanne_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: {PLAYER}!\n"
"My GYM is ready!\p"
"Please visit RUSTBORO whenever\n"
"you can!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2065
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Roxanne_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: At the RUSTBORO GYM,\n"
"the fact that we battled, {PLAYER},\l"
"is a matter of pride.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2070
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brawly_Preparing"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: Hey, there, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I learned a lot from the battle we\n"
"had together.\p"
"I intend to do my training over,\n"
"then reopen the GYM.\p"
"It's going to take some time before\n"
"I'm ready to run the GYM again.\p"
"But if I can reopen the GYM,\n"
"I want you to challenge us again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2081
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brawly_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Congratulations!\p"
"Word about your exploits arrived\n"
"on tidal winds!\p"
"It appears as if I need to work on\n"
"my training some more.\p"
"It's going to take some time before\n"
"I'm ready to run the GYM again.\p"
"But if I can reopen the GYM,\n"
"I want you to challenge us again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2093
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brawly_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"My GYM's ready for action!\p"
"Come back to DEWFORD anytime\n"
"for another challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2099
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brawly_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, I don't think\n"
"I'll ever get bored of battling you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2103
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wattson_Preparing"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Oh, it's you!\p"
"After you left, I've been redoing\n"
"my training from scratch.\p"
"I'd say I could use a wee bit more\n"
"time to reopen my GYM.\p"
"You'll have to wait till then!\n"
"Wahahahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2112
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wattson_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\p"
"You've really done it, haven't you?\n"
"I've been getting word about you!\p"
"It seems I need to retrain some\n"
"more still.\p"
"I'd say I could use a wee bit more\n"
"time to reopen my GYM.\p"
"You'll have to wait till then!\n"
"Wahahahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2123
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wattson_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Oh, it's you!\n"
"My GYM's ready!\p"
"Visit MAUVILLE anytime!\n"
"Wahahahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2129
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wattson_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Wahahaha!\p"
"A battle with you is always charged\n"
"with shocking power!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2134
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Flannery_Preparing"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: {PLAYER}…\p"
"When we battled, I learned exactly\n"
"how immature I was.\p"
"But I'm not done yet!\p"
"I'm going to redo my training and\n"
"reopen the GYM.\p"
"When the time comes, {PLAYER},\n"
"please challenge us again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2144
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Flannery_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: Hello, {PLAYER}?\n"
"Congratulations!\p"
"Word of your success has reached\n"
"us like the heat of a volcano!\p"
"Our training is coming along very\n"
"well here.\p"
"When the GYM's ready, a mark will\n"
"appear beside my name in the\l"
"MATCH CALL list.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2155
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Flannery_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: Oh, {PLAYER}?\n"
"Our GYM's ready!\p"
"Come to LAVARIDGE for a soak\n"
"in the hot spring and a challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2161
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Flannery_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: {PLAYER}…\n"
"I'm positive that you keep getting\l"
"better at training every time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2166
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Winona_Preparing"
msgid ""
"WINONA: Hello, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Thanks to our battle, I've come\n"
"to understand my weak points!\p"
"When I reopen the GYM, I won't go\n"
"down in defeat again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2173
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Winona_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"WINONA: You've done it, {PLAYER}!\p"
"News about the new CHAMPION\n"
"has reached us in FORTREE!\p"
"But… The next time we battle,\n"
"it's not going to end the same way.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2180
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Winona_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"WINONA: Is this {PLAYER}?\n"
"Our GYM is back in operation!\p"
"We're waiting for you in FORTREE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2185
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Winona_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"WINONA: {PLAYER}…\n"
"Though I have lost, my wings will\l"
"never break.\p"
"Yes, in exactly the same way that\n"
"you never lost sight of your dream.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2192
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_TateLiza_Preparing"
msgid ""
"TATE: Oh! You're…\n"
"LIZA: {PLAYER}!\p"
"TATE: We're in training again…\n"
"LIZA: So we can reopen our GYM!\p"
"TATE: When our GYM is ready…\n"
"LIZA: When our GYM is ready…\p"
"TATE: A mark'll appear by our name…\n"
"LIZA: On the MATCH CALL list.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2202
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_TateLiza_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"TATE: {PLAYER}, congratulations!\n"
"LIZA: {PLAYER}, congratulations!\p"
"TATE: The two of us are…\n"
"LIZA: Still in training!\p"
"TATE: We need some more time, but…\n"
"LIZA: When our GYM is ready…\p"
"TATE: A mark'll appear by our name…\n"
"LIZA: On the MATCH CALL list.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2212
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_TateLiza_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"TATE: {PLAYER}!\n"
"LIZA: {PLAYER}!\p"
"TATE: Our GYM is ready!\n"
"LIZA: Our GYM is ready!\p"
"TATE: Please come visit…\n"
"LIZA: MOSSDEEP anytime!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2220
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_TateLiza_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"TATE: {PLAYER}, the battle we had…\n"
"LIZA: Is an invaluable experience.\p"
"TATE: It would be nice if…\n"
"LIZA: We could all battle again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2226
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Juan_Preparing"
msgid ""
"JUAN: Hmm…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}… Was it?\p"
"Our battle together--it brought\n"
"to me memories of when I first\l"
"encountered WALLACE.\p"
"Perhaps you are a genius who may\n"
"yet surpass WALLACE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2235
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Juan_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"JUAN: Fufu… {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"You've finally achieved your goal.\p"
"My eye for appraising talent wasn't\n"
"mistaken…\p"
"I wish for another chance to meet\n"
"you, for you have scaled the peak\l"
"of power and prestige.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2244
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Juan_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"JUAN: Hoho… {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"Our SOOTOPOLIS GYM has finally\n"
"reopened.\p"
"If you wish to see me, you are\n"
"welcome to visit anytime.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2251
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Juan_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"JUAN: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"Like the finest music, the battles\n"
"we wage together strike chords\l"
"of inspiration in my heart…\p"
"When I close my eyes, I see visions\n"
"of you soaring with the melody…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2259
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Sidney"
msgid ""
"SIDNEY: Yo, {PLAYER}!\p"
"If you want to battle with me\n"
"again, you come on back whenever\l"
"you like to the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
"I'll always be here!\n"
"I'll be waiting!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2267
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Phoebe"
msgid ""
"PHOEBE: Hi, {PLAYER}!\p"
"How about coming back here again\n"
"sometime?\p"
"I'd like to see how much tighter\n"
"your bond has grown with your\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2275
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Glacia"
msgid ""
"GLACIA: Hello, {PLAYER}.\p"
"I trust you haven't become\n"
"complacent with your power?\p"
"If you feel the need to cool your\n"
"hot emotions just a little, do come\l"
"to the POKéMON LEAGUE…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2283
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Drake"
msgid ""
"DRAKE: That voice… {PLAYER}, is it?\n"
"You sound well…\p"
"I understand that there is now\n"
"a facility called the BATTLE\l"
"FRONTIER that tests the skills of\l"
"TRAINERS.\p"
"However, if you wish to have real\n"
"battles, there is no substitute for\l"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE!\p"
"Don't you agree, {PLAYER}?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2295
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wallace"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"Have you met STEVEN?\p"
"He is…\n"
"Actually incredibly skilled.\p"
"However, he's an odd soul who\n"
"rarely battles.\p"
"Instead, he would rather look for\n"
"rare stones.\p"
"I'm sure he's digging in a cave or\n"
"a craggy mountain somewhere.\p"
"But what is a rare stone exactly?\n"
"All I can think of is a METEORITE…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2309
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MayRayquazaCall"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I was just in PACIFIDLOG a little\n"
"while ago.\p"
"I saw a giant green POKéMON\n"
"flying high in the sky.\p"
"I…\n"
"I've never seen anything like it.\p"
"I wonder what it was.\n"
"Is this maybe a major discovery?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2324
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_BrendanRayquazaCall"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\n"
"I was in PACIFIDLOG just now.\p"
"I saw this huge green POKéMON\n"
"flying across the sky.\p"
"I've never seen anything that\n"
"amazing before.\p"
"I wish you could've seen it,\n"
"{PLAYER}.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2338
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May1"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"MR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\n"
"but I still see him out on the sea\l"
"with his pet PEEKO sometimes.\p"
"He must love the sea still.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2345
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May2"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"You know how little towns like\n"
"PETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS?\p"
"For some reason, the big port of\n"
"SLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\p"
"When they finally build a GYM there,\n"
"I should apply to be the LEADER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2354
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May3"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Do you remember a man named\n"
"the CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\l"
"He had a house there, remember?\p"
"Well, I found out his younger\n"
"brother lives in MAUVILLE.\p"
"Can you guess his name?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"The ROCK SMASH GUY!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2366
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May4"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"RUSTURF TUNNEL…\n"
"They named it that because it\l"
"joins RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2372
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May5"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, how are you?\p"
"I'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\p"
"I'm going to get a rest at an old\n"
"lady's house.\p"
"She lives just north of\n"
"the desert.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2380
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May6"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Did you know about the MIRAGE\n"
"TOWER in the desert?\p"
"They say, like a mirage, it seems\n"
"to mysteriously come and go.\p"
"I wish I could see it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2388
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May7"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, yahoo!\n"
"I'm on ROUTE 119 now.\p"
"There's a big river here, and\n"
"it often rains.\p"
"I got soaked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2395
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May8"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi.\p"
"MT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\n"
"whose lives have ended.\p"
"Maybe as a result, it's infested\n"
"with many GHOST-type POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2402
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May9"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I was thinking of going to the hot\n"
"spring in LAVARIDGE.\p"
"But on the way, around JAGGED\n"
"PASS, I ran into some bad-looking\l"
"characters. The mood was ugly!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2410
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May10"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Did you see the news?\p"
"They say CAPT. STERN discovered\n"
"the SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\l"
"submarine expedition.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2417
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May11"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Don't you think it's neat?\p"
"Even if you don't have a boat,\n"
"you can cross the sea using\l"
"a POKéMON's move.\p"
"Did you know there's more?\p"
"There's a POKéMON move that lets\n"
"you go to the bottom of the sea.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2427
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May12"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Hope things are okay!\p"
"Have you been on the sea and\n"
"found your way to the other side\l"
"blocked?\p"
"Try diving deep underwater and\n"
"following trenches.\p"
"When you get to the other side,\n"
"come up to the surface. Easy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2438
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May13"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"How's it going?\n"
"Are you filling your POKéDEX?\p"
"I heard a rumor that there are\n"
"super-ancient POKéMON out there.\l"
"And there are three of them!\p"
"I would love to see even one…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2447
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May14"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I heard the rumors!\p"
"You beat the SOOTOPOLIS GYM\n"
"LEADER?\p"
"That means you don't have far\n"
"to go, do you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2455
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_May15"
msgid ""
"MAY: There isn't a single TRAINER\n"
"left in HOENN who doesn't know who\l"
"you are, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"When I tell people that I'm friends\n"
"with you, {PLAYER}{KUN}, they're all\l"
"surprised!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2463
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan1"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
"MR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\n"
"but I still see him out on the sea\l"
"with his pet PEEKO sometimes.\p"
"I guess he must love\n"
"the sea still.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2471
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan2"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I don't get how little towns like\n"
"PETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS.\p"
"I mean, not when the big port of\n"
"SLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\p"
"When they finally build a GYM there,\n"
"I should apply to be the LEADER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2480
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan3"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Yo, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Do you remember a guy named\n"
"the CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\l"
"He had a house there, right?\p"
"Well, it turns out his little\n"
"brother lives in MAUVILLE.\p"
"Can you guess his name?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"The ROCK SMASH GUY!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2492
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan4"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: This voice… {PLAYER}?\p"
"They gave RUSTURF TUNNEL its name\n"
"because it joins RUSTBORO and\l"
"VERDANTURF.\p"
"Did you know that?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2499
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan5"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}, what's up?\p"
"Hey, I'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\p"
"I'm going to rest up at an old\n"
"lady's house north of the desert.\p"
"If you're in the area, you should\n"
"visit her, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2507
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan6"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Did you know about the MIRAGE\n"
"TOWER in the desert?\p"
"They say, like a mirage, it can be\n"
"seen only sometimes.\p"
"I'd like to see that!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2515
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan7"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Who's this? Oh, {PLAYER}?\n"
"Guess what? I'm on ROUTE 119 now.\p"
"There's a big river here, and\n"
"it rains all the time.\p"
"I got soaked to the bone!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2522
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan8"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}!\p"
"MT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\n"
"whose lives have ended.\p"
"That's probably why it's infested\n"
"with many GHOST-type POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2529
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan9"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey there, {PLAYER}.\p"
"I was on my way back to the hot\n"
"spring in LAVARIDGE.\p"
"But around JAGGED PASS, I ran into\n"
"some nasty-looking characters.\p"
"Those creeps…\n"
"I think they were TEAM MAGMA.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2538
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan10"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hi, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Did you catch the news?\p"
"They say CAPT. STERN discovered\n"
"the SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\l"
"submarine expedition.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2545
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan11"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey there, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Don't you think it's awesome?\p"
"Even if you don't have a boat,\n"
"you can cross the sea using\l"
"a POKéMON's move.\p"
"And, there's a move that lets you\n"
"travel to the bottom of the sea.\p"
"Man, POKéMON can do anything!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2555
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan12"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Howdy, {PLAYER}!\n"
"How are you holding up?\p"
"Ever found your way to the other\n"
"side blocked while on the sea?\p"
"Try diving deep underwater and\n"
"following trenches at the bottom.\p"
"When you get to the other side,\n"
"come up to the surface. Simple!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2565
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan13"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey there, {PLAYER}!\p"
"How's it going? Filling up your\n"
"POKéDEX successfully?\p"
"I heard a rumor that there are\n"
"super-ancient POKéMON out there.\l"
"And not just one--three!\p"
"I'd love to catch even one…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2574
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan14"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}!\n"
"I heard the rumors!\p"
"You beat the SOOTOPOLIS GYM\n"
"LEADER? Awesome!\p"
"You're getting awful close now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2581
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Brendan15"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: There isn't a TRAINER in\n"
"all of HOENN who doesn't know who\l"
"you are, {PLAYER}!\p"
"When I tell people that I'm friends\n"
"with you, {PLAYER}, they get pretty\l"
"envious!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2589
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally1"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I've been getting healthier and\n"
"more physically fit.\p"
"I hope I can become a TRAINER like\n"
"you soon, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2596
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally2"
msgid ""
"WALLY: {PLAYER}, hello!\p"
"After RUSTURF TUNNEL went\n"
"through, WANDA's been very happy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2601
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally3"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I… I left my uncle's place in\n"
"VERDANTURF without telling anyone.\p"
"I wonder if he's furious with me…\p"
"{PLAYER}, you understand how\n"
"I feel, don't you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2609
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally4"
msgid ""
"WALLY: {PLAYER}?\n"
"It's me, WALLY!\p"
"The world of TRAINERS is amazing!\p"
"When I have my POKéMON with me,\n"
"all sorts of people say hi!\p"
"It's as if everyone's getting\n"
"connected through POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2618
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally5"
msgid ""
"WALLY: {PLAYER}? It's awesome!\n"
"That RALTS we caught together?\l"
"It evolved, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Maybe I'm talented…\p"
"Oh, but I shouldn't get a big head\n"
"like that!\p"
"After all, it's the POKéMON that\n"
"should be praised!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2628
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally6"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"WALLY appears to be out of\n"
"the POKéNAV's service area…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2634
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Wally7"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Before I met you, I hardly ever\n"
"left my house…\p"
"But now, I'm on an adventure with\n"
"my very own POKéMON…\p"
"{PLAYER}…\n"
"Thank you…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2643
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott1"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Howdy, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"You know how POKéMON can be found\n"
"everywhere?\p"
"Like in the mountains, in the sea,\n"
"in tall grass anywhere?\p"
"Just like POKéMON, you can find\n"
"TRAINERS everywhere, too.\p"
"As a result, I have to hurry\n"
"everywhere, too. Busy, busy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2654
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott2"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: I'm on ROUTE 119 right now.\n"
"It's teeming with TRAINERS!\p"
"It's also overgrown with tall grass\n"
"everywhere, it seems.\p"
"Walking around in shorts here\n"
"makes me all ticklish!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2662
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott3"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hi, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Have you had the chance to climb\n"
"MT. PYRE?\p"
"The place is a memorial to POKéMON\n"
"that have passed away.\p"
"It's somewhere every TRAINER\n"
"should climb to the top of once.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2671
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott4"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I've been hearing about these odd\n"
"gangs being a nuisance.\p"
"TEAM MAGMA and TEAM AQUA,\n"
"I think they were.\p"
"I would think there'd be some\n"
"skilled TRAINERS among them.\p"
"…But if they're thugs…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2681
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott5"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"Might there be tough TRAINERS\n"
"at the bottom of the sea?\p"
"I can't go check for myself.\n"
"I can't swim, for one.\l"
"And I don't raise POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2689
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott6"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hi, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"You know that you can challenge\n"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE when you've\l"
"collected all the GYM BADGES?\p"
"With your talent, becoming the\n"
"CHAMPION isn't a pipe dream.\p"
"But did you know?\n"
"There's somewhere even better.\p"
"But, that's all I'm willing to say\n"
"for the time being.\p"
"It's something you can look\n"
"forward to.\p"
"When you've won your way through\n"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE into the HALL\l"
"OF FAME!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2706
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Scott7"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"SCOTT appears to be out of\n"
"the POKéNAV's service area…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2712
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman1"
msgid ""
"DAD: In RUSTBORO, there's a man\n"
"that goes by the odd name of\l"
"the CUTTER.\p"
"If you're in the area, you should\n"
"pay him a visit.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2719
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman2"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm… Little by little, but also\n"
"very surely, you're getting\l"
"tougher, {PLAYER}.\p"
"The stronger you get, the farther\n"
"and higher you soar from Mother\l"
"and me…\p"
"This feeling is hard to explain.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2728
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman3"
msgid ""
"DAD: I see…\n"
"You've collected four GYM BADGES…\p"
"There's no avoiding it now.\n"
"We will battle like I promised.\p"
"Come anytime.\n"
"We'll all be waiting for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2736
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman4"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}! You'd better go visit\n"
"Mother every so often.\p"
"I'm going to remain here and\n"
"redouble my training.\p"
"The way of battling is deep\n"
"and unforgiving!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2744
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman5"
msgid ""
"DAD: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}!\p"
"What's that? MAGMA EMBLEM?\n"
"I don't know what that's about.\p"
"But with a name like that, it may\n"
"be somehow linked to a volcano!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2751
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman_Preparing"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hiyah! Haah! Dwah!\p"
"…Oh? {PLAYER}!\p"
"You caught me right in the middle\n"
"of a POKéMON training session!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2757
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman_PreparingPostGame"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}!\p"
"Who would've thought you'd become\n"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION…\p"
"Okay!\n"
"I won't be left behind!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2764
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman_RematchReady"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm? {PLAYER}?\n"
"What good timing!\p"
"This time, I'm going to challenge\n"
"you to battle.\p"
"I'm waiting in the PETALBURG GYM.\n"
"Accept my challenge anytime!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2772
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Norman_PostRematch"
msgid ""
"DAD: …You amaze me, {PLAYER}.\n"
"How much higher will you soar?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2776
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven1"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Have you been to MAUVILLE\n"
"already?\p"
"You should visit the BIKE SHOP\n"
"and get a MACH BIKE.\p"
"Then, try exploring the GRANITE\n"
"CAVE thoroughly.\p"
"You may make a new discovery\n"
"there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2787
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven2"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I've met a lot of different\n"
"TRAINERS so far.\p"
"But you're one of a kind.\n"
"You're not like anyone else.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2794
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven3"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"When you're on an adventure with\n"
"your POKéMON, what do you think?\p"
"Do you consider them to be strong\n"
"partners?\p"
"Do you think of them as fun\n"
"companions?\p"
"Depending on how you think, your\n"
"adventure's significance changes.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2805
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven4"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Hello?\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"I'm involved in a spot of trouble\n"
"at the SPACE CENTER.\p"
"I'm sorry, but I can't talk now.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2813
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven5"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Oh!\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"There's no need to talk.\n"
"It's past time for talking.\p"
"You have to believe in yourself\n"
"and do what's right.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2821
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven6"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"STEVEN appears not to be getting\n"
"the call…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2826
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_Steven7"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}… Congratulations\n"
"for entering the HALL OF FAME.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"I hope we can meet again\n"
"somewhere!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2834
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_BirchRegisterCall"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I've already heard about you!\p"
"It seems your POKéNAV's been\n"
"upgraded with MATCH CALL.\p"
"Well, I should register, too!\p"
"That way, I'd be able to examine\n"
"your POKéDEX even while you're\l"
"out in the field.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2845
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_RegisteredBirch"
msgid ""
"Registered PROF. BIRCH\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2849
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_UnusedProfBirch"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: When one has both\n"
"the POKéDEX and POKéNAV, studying\l"
"POKéMON becomes more fun, eh?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2854
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone1"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: Oh? {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Since you called me, the POKéNAV\n"
"must be working properly!\p"
"Other people will be registered,\n"
"so try calling them up, too!\p"
"Good! Good!\n"
"You seem to be quite happy!\p"
"Hm…\n"
"How could I know that?\p"
"It's because I'm looking down at\n"
"you from my office window!\p"
"Wahahaha!\n"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2869
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone2"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: Oh? {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"What's wrong? Have you forgotten\n"
"about that little errand of mine?\p"
"I need you to deliver my letter\n"
"to STEVEN in DEWFORD.\p"
"After that, deliver our parcel to\n"
"CAPT. STERN in SLATEPORT.\p"
"You remember, don't you?\p"
"Now, since I am a busy PRESIDENT,\n"
"I have to go! Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2881
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone3"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Ah, so you've met STEVEN!\n"
"I'd better reward you, then!\p"
"When you visit RUSTBORO again,\n"
"come see me at my office.\p"
"I'll be waiting for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2889
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone4"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Did you know that DEVON was\n"
"digging the RUSTURF TUNNEL?\p"
"But we shut down the operation to\n"
"protect the POKéMON in the area.\p"
"It's a no-brainer, really.\p"
"It's more important to let POKéMON\n"
"live in peace than worry about our\l"
"own convenience.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2900
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone5"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: Hello, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I heard from someone in PETALBURG\n"
"that you're NORMAN's child!\p"
"No wonder you're such a capable\n"
"being!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2907
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone6"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: What's that?\p"
"You battled your own father and\n"
"defeated him?\p"
"That's astounding!\p"
"I had no idea that I befriended\n"
"someone so special! Wahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2915
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone7"
msgid ""
"Hello!\n"
"This is DEVON CORPORATI…\l"
"Oh, hello, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Our PRESIDENT was here a little\n"
"while ago, but he's gone out.\p"
"Our PRESIDENT is busy, but you\n"
"seem to be just as busy, {PLAYER}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2924
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone8"
msgid ""
"…Huh? …What's that?\p"
"GROU… Yes? …DON?\p"
"You're breaking up…\n"
"…can't hear…\p"
"BZZZZ…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2931
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone9"
msgid ""
"…Huh? …What's that?\p"
"Seaflo… Yes? …Caver…?\p"
"You're breaking up…\n"
"…can't hear…\p"
"BZZZZ…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2938
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone10"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: {PLAYER}{KUN}! It's me!\p"
"You were apparently involved in all\n"
"sorts of things, but I, being busy,\l"
"haven't a clue exactly what!\p"
"However, I urge you to take\n"
"the road you believe in and walk it.\p"
"I'll always be in your corner!\n"
"Take care!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/match_call.inc:2948
msgctxt "MatchCall_Text_MrStone11"
msgid ""
"MR. STONE: … … … … … …\n"
"Is this maybe {PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"Your voice is so full of confidence,\n"
"I didn't recognize you right off!\p"
"Hm! You must come visit us at DEVON\n"
"sometime!$"
msgstr ""
